WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:12.250
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and this week
on Arrow we met Barry Allen before he becomes

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:17.150
the flash, we learn all about brother blood’s
super soldier serum and malcolm merlyn runs

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.310
afoul of ra’s al ghul.

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:22.410
So since so much happened i’m going to do
my top 5 moments, then my review and I’ll

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.540
be doing a separate q and a video all about
the flash.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.840
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.149
Remember this is just part 1 of the mid season
finale, next week is part 2.

00:00:31.149 --> 00:00:32.550
Here we go, top 5 moments.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.180
Number 5 - The references.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.180
So I caught several.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.180
see if you spotted these.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.200
The chemical shelf in the lab and the sound
of lightning was a reference to the accident

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.810
that created the first barry allen flash in
the comic books.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:49.020
The Kord Industries centrifuge is a reference
to Ted Kord, one of the many people to become

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.420
the blue beetle in the dc comics.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:55.040
He was also a wealthy industrialist, Like
a nerdier version of tony stark.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.090
The particle accelerator is going to be turned
on soon.

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:00.110
Probably in the next episode.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:04.682
Think about how the idea of speed and the
flash work with the arrival of barry allen.

00:01:04.682 --> 00:01:09.090
The show hasn’t physically shown us the
particle accelerator yet, but if they travel

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.090
to the site next week.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:14.329
You can bet it will be part of how Barry gets
his powers.

00:01:14.329 --> 00:01:18.060
When barry tells Oliver about how his mother
died after a person who looked like a tornado

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.052
came in murdered her, it’s a reference to
professor zoom who killed barry’s mother

00:01:20.052 --> 00:01:24.950
in the comic books.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:30.490
The Argus bunker that has the sedatives- Argus
is the SHIELD - like organization that Amanda

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:34.639
Waller runs and that helps out the justice
league from time to time.

00:01:34.639 --> 00:01:39.319
Nanda Parbat - Malcolm Merlyn references the
home of the league of assassins leading moira

00:01:39.319 --> 00:01:42.560
to contact them and let ra’s al ghul know
that malcolm is still alive.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.560
And pretty much every sentence uttered by
Barry and Felicity when they’re together

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:44.560
teasing us with his destiny as the flash.

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:45.560
Number 4 - The stunts.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:50.799
My favorite stunt was when oliver first goes
after the super soldier, he gets kicked out

00:01:50.799 --> 00:01:51.799
the car door.

00:01:51.799 --> 00:01:53.029
With the door.

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:54.060
Ouch.

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:56.560
Number 3 - Barry and Felicity.

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:59.590
So in case you missed it, the writers are
shipping Barry and Felicity hardcore.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:02.369
All the most fun parts of the episode were
their scenes.

00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:06.109
It’s hilarious that Felicity just dumps
even the thought of being with Oliver when

00:02:06.109 --> 00:02:07.539
Barry questions their relationship.

00:02:07.539 --> 00:02:11.200
And what about their conversation about penetration.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.200
What if he thinks he penetrates just fine.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.200
I feel like Felicity sexytime is just around
the corner.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.110
Number 2 - Felicity brings Barry to the Arrow
Cave.

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.909
So barry is now completely in on Oliver’s
whole operation.

00:02:16.909 --> 00:02:17.909
He just figures it all out with that look
around.

00:02:17.909 --> 00:02:19.019
The weapons, the tech, and Oliver lying comatose
on the table.

00:02:19.019 --> 00:02:20.250
Barry is now officially on team arrow.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:22.400
Think of it as like a justice league teaser.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:27.400
Two members down, one cowl, some oreo’s,
a golden lasso and a red cape and you’re

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.400
good to go.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.140
and my number 1 moment - Meeting Barry Allen.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:33.739
Heir to the speedforce and the only person
on earth faster than superman.

00:02:33.739 --> 00:02:35.290
unless you count professor zoom.

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:37.239
The introduction of barry was so much fun.

00:02:37.239 --> 00:02:38.269
He’s not the flash yet.

00:02:38.269 --> 00:02:39.310
That’s supposed to happen next week.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:40.859
But everything about his first on screen appearance.

00:02:40.859 --> 00:02:44.629
The ‘train imagery’, the pouring droplets
of rain.

00:02:44.629 --> 00:02:51.120
And so so many jokes teasing us.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:55.150
But let me know what your favorite moment
was and if you saw any references that I didn’t

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.150
mention.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:03:00.792
Overall I give the episode an A+ for just
being so much fun and being so bold with all

00:03:00.792 --> 00:03:03.250
the dc universe references.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:07.109
And doing it in a way that felt authentic
to the world arrow has created.

00:03:07.109 --> 00:03:13.150
The writers said that this was all about the
flash being part of oliver story, not oliver

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:21.200
being part of the flash’s story.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:24.250
The soundtrack was really appropriate too.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:27.099
Especially that first scene with Barry and
Felicity alone together.

00:03:27.099 --> 00:03:35.730
It almost sounded like christmas music, like
arrow is giving us a red blurry present.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.579
Don’t open it too fast.

00:03:37.579 --> 00:03:38.610
Let me know what you thought of the episode.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.220
Like I said, next week he will get his powers.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.459
Be sure to subscribe to get my video for that.

